{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1560114-a-couple-of-questions-regarding-the-ves","id":1560114,"title":"A couple of questions regarding the VEs","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2026-05-20T04:19:33-07:00","id":1560114,"title":"A couple of questions regarding the VEs","content":"1. It is noticeable that the Void Engineers' Earth Frontier Division doesn't contain any subdivision specialized at desert environment and exploration. Why is it that? It is simply an elision on the part of writers?<br /> <br /> 2. I have previously noted that the Intelligence Directorate of the PDC and Fleet Intelligence Service of R&amp;E share overlapping roles and responsibilities. And it has been alluded the ID assists other Methodologies, particularly the EFD, in surveillance and security operations in the Near Universe. PDC also has its own in-house R&amp;D division, the Void Construction Corps. Why do the VEs as a whole, and PDC in particular, have such a redundant structure?<br /> <br /> 3. <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The Void Engineers have delved further into the Universe than any other human beings. On the forefront of that effort is the Pan-Dimensional Corps. Its operations take it well past the Spatial Horizon and out into the Deep Universe, establishing beachheads of varying sizes in locales around our galactic volume. Closer to home, the PDC assists the other <i>Conventions</i>, particularly the <i>EFD</i>, in surveillance and security operations in the Near Universe. </div> </div> </div>I think there are some errors in the quoted paragraph. Here, &quot;Conventions&quot; is clearly a misspelling of Methodologies considering the overall context. Do you think the EFD is a misspelling of BCD?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11780-posthumanity","name":"Posthumanity","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-20T04:21:15-07:00","id":1560115,"title":"","content":"I miss-uploaded this post here <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11780-posthumanity","name":"Posthumanity","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"220"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}